  "wrappedAbout": "About Us",
  "wrappedAboutPoints": "<p>We are a group of friends with a shared passion for technology and curiosity about human communication. After years of intense WhatsApp usage, we wanted to understand how our conversations and relationships changed over time.</p><p>As computer scientists we wanted more than raw statistics—we wanted a tool that unites privacy and curiosity. That idea became WhatsAnalyze: a fully local, privacy-first solution that delivers meaningful insights without sharing personal information.</p><p>A tool by users, for users—transparent, secure, and crafted with care.</p>",
